RIFE frame-interpolation inference code (vendored)
==================================================

This directory vendors the RIFE (Real-Time Intermediate Flow Estimation)
HDv3 inference code used by the vivijure-backend finishing stage. It is
redistributed inside the public image ghcr.io/skyphusion-labs/vivijure-backend.

