Relationship to the RIFE model weights
--------------------------------------
This is INFERENCE CODE only; no model weights are vendored here. The RIFE
network weights (flownet.pkl) are a separate artifact with their own MIT
(Megvii Inc.) attribution recorded at
deploy/licenses/imaginairy/rife/LICENSE and in THIRD_PARTY_MODELS.md.
